{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-25T08:58:07.579Z","author":"claude-hub","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e0d15f3cda6eb998be619306","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.282","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"ops-eyi8"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"The guarded launcher template reads a pm-ops directory without package.json as an omit-dev install and skips the merge drivers"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Greptile P2 on pm-slack#117 and pm-starter#115 (2026-09-25), companion hub item pm-cli-website-dqg7. templates/prepare-merge-driver.ts treated MODULE_NOT_FOUND from the pm-ops/package.json probe as proof that pm-ops is absent. A broken install that leaves node_modules/pm-ops as a directory with no package.json, or as a dangling link, fails the probe the same way, so the launcher printed the omit-dev notice, exited 0 and left the clone without merge drivers. The next multi-agent merge would then hard-conflict on tracker files. The fix: an entry at node_modules/pm-ops (lstat, so a dangling link counts) also means present, and the original resolution error is rethrown."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"in_progress"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["fail-open","merge-driver","multi-agent"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-09-25T08:58:07.579Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-25T08:58:07.579Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"claude-hub"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A consumer whose node_modules/pm-ops is a directory without package.json, or a dangling link, fails the prepare hook without the skip notice; An absent pm-ops still skips with exactly one notice; Both new fixture cases fail against the previous template"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"ops-mqdi","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-09-25T08:58:07.579Z","author":"claude-hub","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"asserted"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"7b065cbb16cce80b9b6c335b7333cdf0fc2518512f1618d0373d643e47e79591","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"39ebd3e6fee7e51c9749dfd3a3b36656a8d631a3ef0ed1d217ac86c044323640"}
